le). \n\n*Double-checking* \n- If GF had been calm and user called her names for no reason - 1 \n- But here, user was trying to de-escalate, then later called names *because* she was publicly abusive to a minor. \n- Reddit AITA consensus would likely be \" not the asshole\" for this scenario. \n\nYes. Answer is 0.\n",
